Common Garage Door Issues
Garage doors experience daily wear and tear, leading to problems such as:
    • Broken garage door springs 
    • Worn or snapped cables 
    • Misaligned or bent tracks 
    • Noisy or damaged rollers 
    • Garage door opener malfunctions 
    • Faulty safety sensors 
    • Garage doors stuck open or closed 
Ignoring these warning signs can result in more extensive damage and expensive repairs.
